2. **tterm** (July 21, 2026) - macOS cockpit combining terminal, browser, and Claude Code for AI-powered development

3. **Sim** (July 9, 2026) - Open-source workspace for building and orchestrating AI agents and workflows with 1000+ integrations

4. **Miora** (July 9, 2026) - AI-native creative studio with persistent agent memory for maintaining brand consistency

5. **Rerun** (July 21, 2026) - No-code AI agent builder for automating workflows like invoice chasing and lead qualification

All products have been verified through Product Hunt launches and secondary sources, meeting the criteria of:
- Launched within the last 14 days (July 10-24, 2026 window)
